Scope: One memo per request, from one meeting notes file: the decisions made and the action items (who does what, by when). Nothing else: no attendee list, no next-meeting date.
Read-only inputs: /private/tmp/hirearchy-p2/R1-1793275867/notes. Read them (kiro `read`, or hirearchy `read` by absolute path); never create, edit or delete anything there.
